{"data": [{"author_id": "1801357959319912448", "created_at": "2026-11-09T15:50:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119819823580320108"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/tDAu3jwcdn", "end": 244, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yxinsights/status/2119819823580320108/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119819818966622208", "start": 221, "url": "https://t.co/tDAu3jwcdn"}]}, "id": "2119819823580320108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 936, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I keep watching the Treasury cash pile. It is back below $1 trillion.\n\nThe TGA fell to $923 billion on 5 Nov from $1,053 billion on 27 Oct.\n\nReverse repo near zero means that drawdown feeds almost 1:1 into bank reserves. https://t.co/tDAu3jwcdn", "url": "https://x.com/yxinsights/status/2119819823580320108"}, {"author_id": "1749397336546045953", "created_at": "2026-11-09T01:27:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119602702778876296"], "id": "2119602702778876296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 201, "impression_count": 46939, "like_count": 656, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 46, "retweet_count": 78}, "text": "You are all staring at 5-min Bitcoin candles while the $2.55 trillion safety net under the US banking system just vanished.\n\nCheck the Federal Reserve’s own ledger from Friday afternoon:\nThe Overnight Reverse Repo buffer- the massive cash cushion that kept the banking grid from", "url": "https://x.com/afsheenjaf/status/2119602702778876296"}, {"author_id": "1880965005493075968", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:11:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119779816899584168"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/SXegjFpnze", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SedarZan52448/status/2119779816899584168/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119779739518775296", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/SXegjFpnze"}]}, "id": "2119779816899584168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Funding | Repo is trading above the Fed's reserve rate\n\nSOFR has printed above IORB (3.90%) every day since Oct 23 \n\nRange: 3.92% to 3.97% \n\nTop 1% of trades hit 4.00% to 4.05%, at or above the Fed's standing repo rate \n\nWhy now: the RRP buffer is gone (~$0.15B on Nov 6) \n\nSo https://t.co/SXegjFpnze", "url": "https://x.com/SedarZan52448/status/2119779816899584168"}, {"author_id": "1397870742180597761", "created_at": "2026-11-08T11:01:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119384737378611458"], "id": "2119384737378611458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When Treasury spends from its Fed account, bank reserves often rise.\n\nFed H.4.1, Wed 4 Nov vs 28 Oct:\n📉 TGA: $936bn (−$79bn)\n📈 Bank reserves: $2.96tn (+$68bn)\n\nFact: cash left the Treasury's Fed account.\nInterpretation: that usually shows up as higher bank reserves — more", "url": "https://x.com/HumptyDigital/status/2119384737378611458"}, {"author_id": "1880965005493075968", "created_at": "2026-11-09T14:40:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119802392543646208"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/tpx1r4Xkj5", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SedarZan52448/status/2119802392543646208/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119802328769236992", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/tpx1r4Xkj5"}]}, "id": "2119802392543646208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🚨Congress is back. Funding runs out Dec 11 \n\nKalshi prices ~38% for a Dec 12 shutdown \nPolymarket ~34%, and ~43% by year-end \n\nNot a new high \nOdds hit ~45% after the midterms, fell to ~26%, then rebounded \n\nWhat matters for markets:\nNov NFP (Dec 4), Nov CPI (Dec 10) and the Dec https://t.co/tpx1r4Xkj5", "url": "https://x.com/SedarZan52448/status/2119802392543646208"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-11-09T20:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119882724102078518"], "id": "2119882724102078518", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏛️ Traditional Markets &amp; Macro-Liquidity: November 09, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Liquidity Plumbing: Early-month payouts cut the point-in-time TGA by USD 79.38 billion to USD 936.25 billion and lifted weekly average bank reserves by USD 36.32 billion to USD 2,930.09", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2119882724102078518"}, {"author_id": "1581815345085648898", "created_at": "2026-11-09T20:37:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119892148770177365"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 13, "id": "2239426952", "start": 0, "username": "LeonWaidmann"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/kobeissiletter…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/kobeissiletter/status/2119181497529684135", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/dqJKKMlwd5"}]}, "id": "2119892148770177365", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119181497529684135", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "@LeonWaidmann \n\n🤔 there is a positive liquidity signal here—and bank reserves improved considerably more than that $3 billion headline suggests.\n\nThe Fed’s own figures confirm $6.748 trillion in assets on November 4, up $2.51 billion that week and approximately $212 billion https://t.co/dqJKKMlwd5", "url": "https://x.com/QeYcc/status/2119892148770177365"}, {"author_id": "215536840", "created_at": "2026-11-08T03:18:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119268403496300630"], "id": "2119268403496300630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Market Liquidity Comprehensive Analysis Report | 2026-11-07\nTGA releasing short-term cash, reserves rebounding, and repo premiums narrowing, but the 20-day liquidity proxy remains negative; credit and equity pressures have not yet eased in sync.\nTwo different types of improvement", "url": "https://x.com/williamswjt/status/2119268403496300630"}, {"author_id": "2041571451782762496", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:21:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119238806012571972"], "id": "2119238806012571972", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 722, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🚨 UPSC PRELIMS TRAP: Repo Rate vs Reverse Repo Rate\n\n• The Trap:\n\"An increase in the Repo Rate increases liquidity in the banking system and encourages banks to borrow more from the RBI.\"\n\n• The Reality:\n\n1. Repo Rate:\nThe rate at which the RBI lends short-term funds to", "url": "https://x.com/Important4UPSC/status/2119238806012571972"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119867622582034776"], "id": "2119867622582034776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚖️ Market Intelligence Outlook Report: November 09, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Macro Overview: Fed Net Liquidity rose USD 81.93 billion to USD 5,811.75 billion on early-month TGA payouts, lifting weekly average bank reserves to USD 2,930.09 billion. Yet China's 5.7", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2119867622582034776"}, {"author_id": "34660476", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:19:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119872509612880343"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Dwzd09oIiu", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ODB123/status/2119872509612880343/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119872505577865216", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/Dwzd09oIiu"}]}, "id": "2119872509612880343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 633, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔥🔥🔥 November 9th Federal Reserve reverse repo results are in!\n\n💰 $252 million submitted\n💰 $252 million accepted\n🏦 3 counterparties\n📅 Overnight maturity November 10th\n\nAll $252M was placed with the Fed against Treasury collateral.\n\nImportant distinction.\n\nReverse repo https://t.co/Dwzd09oIiu", "url": "https://x.com/ODB123/status/2119872509612880343"}, {"author_id": "2799321963", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:51:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119548402379940087"], "id": "2119548402379940087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Lao reverse repo bankrupt hedge ubs perpetual china calls notes 🤣🤣", "url": "https://x.com/FlipTheNarative/status/2119548402379940087"}, {"author_id": "1480854927102693380", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:13:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119750341726028179"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/afsheenjaf/sta…", "end": 248, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/afsheenjaf/status/2119602702778876296", "start": 225, "url": "https://t.co/RSTs1bOtHc"}]}, "id": "2119750341726028179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119602702778876296", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "For 2 years, the US government funded trillions in reckless deficits without blowing up the system because money market funds drained that Reverse Repo cushion to absorb the debt.\nNow that buffer is empty. Zero padding left. https://t.co/RSTs1bOtHc", "url": "https://x.com/VanAccy/status/2119750341726028179"}, {"author_id": "2119771685020672000", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:52:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_i